Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root for every task. It covers ownership, the one-agent-per-folder rule, the per-issue workflow, the CHANGELOG handoff protocol and the rules that must never break.

In this repo, Cursor is Arnav's tool for coding, backend engineering and infrastructure. Its issues carry the `agent:cursor` label. Before you edit anything, read `CHANGELOG.md` and the issue's latest checkpoint comment.
